+# =================================================================================================== P1T-FIX2
+# Regression tests for the P1T-REV2 round-2 findings (order P1T_FIX2_ROBUSTNESS.md). Crash-prone paths run in
+# subprocesses (the reviewer's host_checks.py / core_shutdown.py pattern).
